After dinner, I sit on the sofa.
I rest a little.
Then I take my phone.
I call my family in Mexico.
In Mexico, it is afternoon now.
My little sister Sofia answers.
She smiles into the camera.
"Hello Maya!" she calls cheerfully.
"Hello Sofia!" I answer.
"How are you in Berlin?" she asks.
"Thank you, very good," I say.
Today everything is good.
We talk about my day.
Suddenly I hear a noise.
Our dog Lola jumps onto the sofa next to Sofia.
Lola looks directly into the camera.
She barks loudly.
Sofia and I laugh.
"Lola misses you," Sofia says.
"I miss you guys too," I answer.
